 "Persistence backend peers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/intro/installation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "SQLite and Cloudflare D1 need none; libSQL, pg, mariadb, mssql, mongodb (pin ^6), cassandra-driver, the AWS SDKs and fzstd cover the rest."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_intro_installation_message_broker_peers", "label": "Message broker and WebSocket peers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/intro/installation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "@hono/node-ws has a real 1.2.0 floor: the transport frame cap is written onto the ws server only 1.2.0 and newer expose, and older versions are refused rather than served uncapped."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_intro_installation_typescript_configuration", "label": "TypeScript configuration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/intro/installation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The framework relies on noImplicitOverride to catch lifecycle-method typos such as onRecieve instead of onReceive."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_intro_installation_verify_the_install", "label": "Verify the install", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/intro/installation.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "terminate() drains the mailbox before it stops anything, so pong prints without a sleep in between; a missing pong means the runtime is below the minimum version."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_intro_installation_installation", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_intro_installation_runtime_requirements", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", 